        <p source="#source-104379-104474"><seg source="#source-104379-104418">ホウシ　　　　　　　　備後</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-104418-104445"><rb>深安</rb><rt>ふかやす</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-104445-104448">・</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-104448-104472"><rb>沼隈</rb><rt>ぬまくま</rt></ruby></p>
