        <p source="#source-105523-105594"><seg source="#source-105523-105562">ホトケンボウ　　　　　常陸</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-105562-105589"><rb>稲敷</rb><rt>いなしき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-105589-105594">郡</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-105594-105662"><seg source="#source-105594-105633">ボウズ　　　　　　　　加賀</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-105633-105657"><rb>河北</rb><rt>かほく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-105657-105662">郡</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-105662-105733"><seg source="#source-105662-105701">デンボウシ　　　　　　備前</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-105701-105731"><rb>下津井</rb><rt>しもつい</rt></ruby></p>
        <p source="#source-105733-105801"><seg source="#source-105733-105772">ヒガンボウズ　　　　　安芸</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-105772-105796"><rb>佐伯</rb><rt>さえき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-105796-105801">郡</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-105801-105866"><seg source="#source-105801-105840">ヒガンボウズ　　　　　周防</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-105840-105861"><rb>玖珂</rb><rt>くが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-105861-105866">郡</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-105866-105913"><seg source="#source-105866-105913">ヒガンボウ　　　　　　石見大森</seg></p>
