        <p source="#source-107995-108063"><seg source="#source-107995-108034">ツクボウシ　　　　　　肥後</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-108034-108058"><rb>鹿本</rb><rt>かもと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-108058-108063">郡</seg></p>
